{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16223020","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16223020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1622302001:1":{"text":"아, 친구! 마침 잘 왔어. 난 낚시 동아리 회장 파라셀이라고 해.","source_cn":"啊！同学，你来得正好！我是学院的钓鱼社社长帕拉塞。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8773B0A0D50D360C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아, 친구! 마침 잘 왔어. 난 낚시 동아리 회장 파라셀이라고 해.","female":"아, 친구! 마침 잘 왔어. 난 낚시 동아리 회장 파라셀이라고 해.","variant_male_record_index":"211326","variant_female_record_index":"211327","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1622302002:1":{"text":"내 보물인 피쉬킹 <style=\"highlight\">팬텀 워커</style>가 사라졌어!","source_cn":"我的宝贝鱼王<style=highlight>幻灵星游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36FFFD98A1599F0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1622302003:1":{"text":"그리고 얘는 <style=\"highlight\">부엉이</style>라고, 내 올빼미야. 야간 우편배달을 맡고 있어.","source_cn":"而这家伙——<style=highlight>咕咕</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15C1C2C326EAB85A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1622302004:1":{"text":"얘가 하루 종일 팬텀 워커랑 붙어 다녔으니까 분명 뭔가 알고 있을 거란 말이지.","source_cn":"它整天跟幻灵星游腻在一块儿，肯定知道些内情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF76D5C3DDDF370AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1622302005:1":{"text":"그런데 문제는 내 어설픈 변신술로는... 에테르 숲을 사이에 두고 서로 외치는 것처럼 말이 안 통해!","source_cn":"可问题是，我这半吊子变形术……和它沟通起来就跟隔着空境...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52E28B59A4CAF10D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1622302006:1":{"text":"너 말이야, <style=\"highlight\">변신술</style>은 좀 해?","source_cn":"你的<style=highlight>变形术</sty...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE24915BF760A2337","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너 말이야, <style=\"highlight\">변신술</style>은 좀 해?","female":"너 말이야, <style=\"highlight\">변신술</style>은 좀 해?","variant_male_record_index":"211332","variant_female_record_index":"211333","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1622302006":{"text":"너 말이야, <style=\"highlight\">변신술</style>은 좀 해?","source_cn":"你的<style=highlight>变形术</style>水平怎么样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE24915BF760A2337","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너 말이야, <style=\"highlight\">변신술</style>은 좀 해?","female":"너 말이야, <style=\"highlight\">변신술</style>은 좀 해?","variant_male_record_index":"211332","variant_female_record_index":"211333","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622302007:1":{"text":"드디어 적임자를 찾았네!","source_cn":"太棒了，可算找对人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9487BD98ABC3DDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622302010:1":{"text":"제발! 통역 좀 해줘. 부엉이한테 팬텀 워커가 어디 갔는지 좀 물어봐 줄 수 있을까?","source_cn":"拜托你，帮我翻译一下，问问咕咕，幻灵星游到底去哪了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x93077ED3E9731117","variant_status":"runtime_gend